<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Firstly, I carried out a study of what existed in the field of learning programming languages. Through my analysis, I will present the work and research that I was able to carry out during my internship to learn more about all aspects of programming languages.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
