143 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (And thirdly, it will be devoted to the work carried out during my internship. I will present in detail the different activities in which I participated, the tools and methods I used as well as the results I obtained. I will also highlight the challenges encountered and the solutions implemented to overcome them. This section will illustrate how I was able to apply my theoretical knowledge to concrete situations within Adeisse.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
