/ActualText (Finally, I will conclude this report by summarizing the points that I addressed and providing an overall assessment of my internship. I will evaluate the results obtained in relation to the objectives initially set. In addition, I will also discuss future prospects in the field of learning programming languages.)
/Pg 9 0 R
